SharpHand.ng – Technical Documentation
1. Overview
SharpHand.ng is a mobile-first, web-based platform connecting users to nearby skilled workers. The platform focuses on simplicity:
    • Users select a service → see nearby workers → get connected instantly
    • No in-app payments in the MVP (later added)
    • Workers may be monetized via subscriptions or featured listings in future phases
Target Devices:
    • Mobile (primary)
    • Desktop (secondary, responsive design)
Core Goal:
    • Fast, reliable connections between users and local service providers

